OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Flate evening sunshine, followed by a
OL,7,Fclear night with light winds.
OL,8,FTemperatures a touch lower than of
OL,9,Flate, so may make for more comfortable
OL,10,Fsleeping conditions. Some patchy cloud
OL,11,Fpotentially developing by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FAny morning cloud quickly
OL,14,Fclearing to leave a dry and sunny day
OL,15,Facross the region. The sunshine may
OL,16,Fturn hazy at times. Feeling pleasant,
OL,17,Fwith a light northerly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
