OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCloudy
OL,6,FMonday with brighter breaks possible.
OL,7,FTuesday will bring cloud and outbreaks
OL,8,Fof rain. This clearing to sunny spells
OL,9,FWednesday, with the chance of a few
OL,10,Fshowers. Temperatures nearer average.
